Revela comes in two ready-to-run editions. Neither needs an installer or any other software:

- **Standalone:** one program with the theme and all plugins built in. The right choice for almost everyone.
- **Full:** the same program plus every plugin and theme as separate packages, so you can add, remove or bring your own.

Not sure which Windows version you need? Most PCs are **x64**; choose **ARM64** only for Windows on ARM laptops (for example Snapdragon-based Copilot+ PCs). Downloads for Intel-based Macs are not available.

---

## Standalone <small>(recommended)</small>

A single executable with the default theme and all built-in plugins (compression, preview server, OneDrive sync, EXIF statistics, calendar) baked in. No .NET SDK, no plugin downloads, no internet connection required after the initial download.

**Pick this if:** you just want to publish a photography portfolio.

